{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c3ad7f007fa6de08","name":"Clone Naval Officer","source":{"id":"source:reference-c3ad7f007fa6de08","title":"Clone Naval Officer","revision":19849,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:43:46Z","sha256":"5835a2c200f73a5b4e3c7ea8d378e13b174360fa6f2959f71b21663f8be44e0b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19849","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Clone%20Naval%20Officer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c3ad7f007fa6de08","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Even among the clones of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jango Fett"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jango_Fett","referenceId":"reference:bf47d6b339ff73dd"},", there are a select number that prove themselves capable of understanding and executing naval strategy to a greater degree than their comrades. These clones are put into special training programs where they learn the technical and tactical aspects of naval command. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kaminoan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kaminoan","referenceId":"reference:5acecf7158f82e5c"}," scientists speculate that these clones' aptitude for space combat comes from Jango Fett's understanding of dogfighting tactics, and many of these clones eventually go on to become Clone Officers in the Republic Navy. Though most of these officers are lower-tier commanders and aides to nonclone superior officers, some Clone Naval Officers take command of small clone space units and may act as the executive officer for a squadron of ",{"tag":"a","children":["V-19 Torrent Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/V-19_Torrent_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:d0fff84b574909aa"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["ARC-170 Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ARC-170_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:fd7701de3a3d42d7"}," pilots. All Clone Naval Officers are also certified to pilot the ",{"tag":"a","children":["V-19 Torrent Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/V-19_Torrent_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:d0fff84b574909aa"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["ARC-170 Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ARC-170_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:fd7701de3a3d42d7"},", and the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Nu"]},"-Class Attack Shuttle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nu-Class_Attack_Shuttle","referenceId":"reference:ff226dbb7eb3b78a"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Most Clone Naval Officers are stationed aboard the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," used by the Republic. Despite their training, many believe that these clones are not particularly suited for the role of an officer, and tensions sometimes arise between the clones and the nonclone members of the Republic Navy.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Clone Naval Officer Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 6/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}